      "mergedPostDetails": "When I would open the big menu there would be an extra menu next to my menu. Also the typing menu would open while I was in the menu and so I couldn't press anything because the menus would over lap one over the other. I had to shut down all of vrc to regain control. I would also leave small menu windows when I would close it. maybe it was an isolated incident because It appears I can't repeat it.",
