      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thanks for the Update @{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}!\nI'm also no longer able to break the UI in that way, Tabs etc work fine even in full and laggy lobbies.\nThe other issues mentioned in this canny still persist though, for example Nameplates are still really really slow at updating when in big lobbies and the Portal Drop also still lags behind you hand. Any Updates on these issues?",
